                "text": "Trump said he would bring down the cost of groceries. He said he would make our lives better.\n\nHe lied.\n\nThe only people whose lives have improved are Trump's billionaire friends.\n\nRepublicans prefer to shut down the government than ensure your family has affordable health care. https://t.co/0sLukvwFf7",
