                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Honored to join Mayor Scott for the 32nd Annual Civil Rights Breakfast. \n\nWith Voting Rights, education access, health care, and so much on the line, today\u2019s challenges demand that someone stand for justice. I\u2019m proud to stand in this fight with so many of you. https://t.co/A5nratYt1P",
