                "reply_count": 4513,
                "retweet_count": 375,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I have a question: Can anyone aside from the billionaires claim their life has gotten because of this presidency? NO.\u00a0\n\nHave your grocery prices gone down? NO.\u00a0\n\nHave your health care costs gone down? NO.\u00a0\n\nThis Administration is failing. https://t.co/IbjrEBqK8y",
