                "quoted_status_profile_username": "WSJ",
                "reply_count": 265,
                "retweet_count": 140,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Inflation is the highest it's been since Trump took office.\n\nTrump\u2019s economy is FAILING. Grocery prices, rent, and health care costs are skyrocketing.\n\nAnd Republicans would still rather keep our government shut down than lower health care costs.",
